{"slug":"travelsafe","title":"Travelsafe","desc":"Help your people to travel safe whether it's for business, commuting or meeting friends after work. Give them a travel safety app.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Travelsafe-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Travel Safety App\",\"title\":\"Travelsafe\",\"intro\":\"Help your people to travel safe whether it’s for business, commuting or meeting friends after work. Give them a travel safety app.\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Travelsafe-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Travel safe from A to B\",\"title\":\"How Travelsafe Helps Employees Travel Safely\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/915626033\",\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Employees enter their start point, destination and how they’re travelling – just like a regular travel app.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Travelsafe calculates how long the journey should take and generates an estimated arrival time alongside a timed alarm. If your employee hasn’t reached their destination by the ETA, the alarm is activated.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Alarms are answered in under 6 seconds (on average) and handled by expertly trained controllers in the Peoplesafe <a href=\"/uk/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre</a> (ARC).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Reassuring check-ins\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/travelsafe-web-image.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Help your team travel safe with automated check-ins that can be scheduled at set points during their journey (e.g. every 15 minutes).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The app will send regular notifications, or ‘welfare checks’ asking the staff member to confirm if they’re okay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If they respond ‘no’ to a welfare check, an SOS alarm will automatically be raised to the Peoplesafe ARC.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If they don’t respond at all, the app will send further prompts and calls. If these go unanswered, an <a href=\"/uk/products/mysos/\">SOS alarm</a> call is sent to the ARC who will start the escalation process to get help.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Faster help in an emergency\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/travelsafe-web-image2.png@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Staff can input important information about their journey on the travel safe app. If an alarm is raised, <a href=\"/uk/blogs/day-in-the-life-of-an-arc-controller/\">ARC Controllers</a> can use these notes to make quick decisions about what help is needed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Important information could be the:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>registration number of the taxi</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>planned route</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>names of travel companions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Travel Safe\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/travelsafe-web-image3.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When your employee arrives at their destination safely, the timed alarm will be cancelled automatically.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If their journey is taking a bit longer than expected, the travel safe app sends them a prompt to extend the timer (if safe to do so).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Emergency help – fast</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If the ETA expires and your employee hasn’t arrived at their destination or responded to prompts and calls, an SOS alarm will automatically be raised. The Peoplesafe ARC will respond to the alarm and get help directly to your staff member.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/side-tabs {\"title\":\"\",\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Public transport\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eReassurance for your staff when travelling by train, bus or tram.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/public-transport-1024x245.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Walking\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTravelling on foot is safer with route and destination logging.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/iStock-545335062-modified-8b229594-3a8b-4e27-a387-ee6acd687a39-1024x341.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Driving\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eReassurance for the drive to work, home or to and from appointments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/driving-1024x245.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Cycling\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePeace of mind for the commute and leisure rides.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/iStock-1907003920-modified-a0381719-ee68-4f96-bd14-dd4fadf3c30d-1024x341.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Taxi\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eSafer cab journeys with driver and vehicle details recorded.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/taxi-1024x245.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"International\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eProtection when travelling globally – when paired with our international services.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/international-1024x245.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Travelsafe Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/12/2/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how our travel safe app can enhance the safety and security of your workers when they travel and on their commute?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how Travelsafe provides reliable protection and rapid response to ensure your employees are protected on every journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/12/2/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/faq {\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"How does Travelsafe work?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eBased on your destination and mode of travel, an automated alarm is set for your ETA. Throughout the journey, you will receive regular welfare check-ins to make sure you’re safe. If, at any point, the response is ‘no,’ or if you fail to respond to welfare checks and subsequent prompts or follow-up calls, an SOS alarm is immediately raised to Peoplesafe’s control centre.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIf you fail to reach your destination, or don’t respond to automated check-ins, the control centre will contact you to make sure you’re safe.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOnce you arrive safely at your destination, the app uses your location to automatically close the timer, so that you don’t have to remember to cancel it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Travelsafe app free?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo, Travelsafe is an optional extra on the Peoplesafe app. There is an additional subscription charge to use this professional service.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How accurate is Travelsafe?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTravelsafe uses the phone’s built-in location services to determine the journey start point and the person’s location throughout – just like a regular travel app.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e10 minutes prior to the ETA, Travelsafe will recalculate the arrival time and automatically extend the timer if necessary (e.g. due to heavier traffic conditions).\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWhen the person gets within a 10 metre radius of their destination, the timer will automatically cancel.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Is Travelsafe available on both Apple and Android\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes, Travelsafe is available on iOS and Android.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how Travelsafe works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a demo of our travel safe app, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003ca href=\\\"\\\"\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2023-12-06/2h112b\",\"height\":500} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Related Products\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:sos-app@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:lone-worker-app@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:eurowatch@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:global-response@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":5,"types":["features","safety-apps"]}